From: logos-node-android
Subject: [BENCH PATCH 9001] Timing spans inside the ledger update, for replay profiling only

Applies on top of native/patches/0001. Built only as the Linux "profile" variant to measure
where replay time goes inside the ledger transition. Never shipped, never on a phone build.
It adds timing counters around the parent-state clone, the cryptarchia and mantle header
updates, the seen-block record, the transaction loop and the block accounting, and one more
summary line at the end of the startup replay.

